                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
                        <Array as="points">
                            <mxPoint x="-765" y="1200"/>
                        </Array>
                        <mxPoint x="-570" y="1210" as="targetPoint"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="df5QGg9pBindMdLRdbmP-24" value="ext-proc" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-850" y="1070" width="170" height="60" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="df5QGg9pBindMdLRdbmP-31" value="" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-375" y="545" width="20" height="20" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="df5QGg9pBindMdLRdbmP-32" value="" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="260" y="600" width="20" height="20" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="df5QGg9pBindMdLRdbmP-33" value="" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="50" y="570" width="20" height="20" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="df5QGg9pBindMdLRdbmP-34" value="" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-150" y="650" width="20" height="20" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="v1fgUgKVJFfnq_5Shl6K-1" value="" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-2370" y="-720" width="804" height="846" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="v1fgUgKVJFfnq_5Shl6K-2" value="&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Based on the knowledge sources, the &lt;code&gt;hits_addend&lt;/code&gt; value used in Envoy's rate limit descriptor population &lt;strong&gt;can be a decimal (floating-point) number&lt;/strong&gt;, not just an integer.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;The relevant code in &lt;code&gt;ratelimit_config.cc&lt;/code&gt; shows:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-cpp&quot;&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;if (hits_addend_value.has_number_value()) {&lt;br&gt;    hits_addend = hits_addend_value.number_value();&lt;br&gt;} else if (hits_addend_value.has_string_value()) {&lt;br&gt;    // Attempt to parse the string as a double.&lt;br&gt;    success = absl::SimpleAtod(hits_addend_value.string_value(), &amp;amp;hits_addend);&lt;br&gt;} else {&lt;br&gt;    // Only number and string values are allowed.&lt;br&gt;    success = false;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;// Check value range.&lt;br&gt;if (hits_addend &amp;lt; 0 || hits_addend &amp;gt; MAX_HITS_ADDEND) {&lt;br&gt;    success = false;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;if (success) {&lt;br&gt;    descriptor.hits_addend_ = static_cast&amp;lt;uint64_t&amp;gt;(hits_addend);&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;[&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/blob/main/source/extensions/filters/common/ratelimit_config/ratelimit_config.cc#L175-L253&quot;&gt;ratelimit_config.cc&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;So the value is accepted as a &lt;code&gt;double&lt;/code&gt; (floating-point), but it is then &lt;strong&gt;cast to &lt;code&gt;uint64_t&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; via &lt;code&gt;static_cast&amp;lt;uint64_t&amp;gt;(hits_addend)&lt;/code&gt; before being used. This means:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Input:&lt;/strong&gt; Can be a decimal number (e.g., &lt;code&gt;1.7&lt;/code&gt; from a number or string value).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stored/used:&lt;/strong&gt; Truncated to an integer (&lt;code&gt;uint64_t&lt;/code&gt;) — the decimal part is dropped.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;3&quot;&gt;In practice, while you &lt;em&gt;can&lt;/em&gt; pass a decimal value, it will be truncated to a whole number when applied. The valid range is &lt;code&gt;0&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;1,000,000,000&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;code&gt;MAX_HITS_ADDEND&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-2430" y="360" width="800" height="740" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="v1fgUgKVJFfnq_5Shl6K-3" value="" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-2320" y="1477" width="1133" height="553" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="-3ZnGCk43JuBwP6l3J2V-1" style="edgeStyle=none;curved=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;exitX=0.855;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=8.225458568226165;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.106;entryY=0.997;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontSize=16;startSize=14;endArrow=open;endSize=14;sourcePerimeterSpacing=8;targetPerimeterSpacing=8;" parent="1" source="OnmnXBfdHe-ymCt0516s-16" target="z2IbIjrtrvv-g8Q2EWYd-3" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
