                <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#10;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    participant C as Client (opencode)\n    participant LB as Hetzner LB 46.225.38.138\n    participant E as Envoy (core-gateway pod)\n    participant X as ai-gateway-extproc (UDS sidecar)\n    participant A as Authorino :50051\n    participant RL as envoy-ratelimit :8081\n    participant R as redis-ha\n    participant M as qwen3-5-2b (ClusterIP → pod)\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;LB: TLS ClientHello, SNI api.ai.camer.digital\n    LB-&gt;&gt;E: to a worker node → Envoy pod\n    Note over E: api-https filter chain picked by SNI, TLS terminated (cert via SDS)\n    Note over E: route match 1: no x-ai-eg-model yet → rule/1 (404 fallback)\n    E-&gt;&gt;X: filter 0 ext_proc/aigateway: headers + buffered body\n    X--&gt;&gt;E: set x-ai-eg-model qwen3-5-2b-local, clear route cache\n    Note over E: route match 2 → httproute/converse/qwen3-5-2b-local/rule/0\n    E-&gt;&gt;A: filter 6 ext_authz (fail-closed)\n    A--&gt;&gt;E: OK + x-oidc-*, x-account-id, x-billing-plan, x-model-policy + budget metadata\n    Note over E: lua/0 billing-period · lua/1 model-policy (403 if not allowed) · lua/2 budget-limiter (402 if spent)\n    E-&gt;&gt;RL: filter 12 ratelimit: ShouldRateLimit(descriptors, +1)\n    RL-&gt;&gt;R: INCRBY per-minute key\n    RL--&gt;&gt;E: OK (or OVER_LIMIT → 429) · unreachable → allowed (fail-open)\n    E-&gt;&gt;X: upstream filter: translate, override model name, credentials\n    E-&gt;&gt;M: router → STRICT_DNS cluster → 10.43.116.109:8080\n    M--&gt;&gt;E: SSE token stream\n    E-&gt;&gt;X: response: extract usage → dynamic metadata io.envoy.ai_gateway\n    E--&gt;&gt;C: streamed completion\n    Note over E: access log with DYNAMIC_METADATA via OTel → Alloy → Loki&quot;,&#10;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#10;}" id="MqUB_hJPA-UFwMzICl9q-42">
                    <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
                        <mxGeometry as="geometry"/>
                    </mxCell>
                </UserObject>
                <UserObject label="Client (opencode)" mermaidId="n:C" mermaidBaseStyle="html=1;shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;elbowEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;elbow&quot;:&quot;vertical&quot;,&quot;curved&quot;:0,&quot;rounded&quot;:0};lifelineDashed=0;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=6;lifelineColor=light-dark(#9370DB,#cccccc);size=65;lifelineMirror=1;fillColor=light-dark(#ECECFF,#1f2020);strokeColor=light-dark(#9370DB,#cccccc);fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=16;" mermaidBaseValue="Client (opencode)" id="MqUB_hJPA-UFwMzICl9q-43">
                    <mxCell parent="MqUB_hJPA-UFwMzICl9q-42" style="html=1;shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;elbowEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;elbow&quot;:&quot;vertical&quot;,&quot;curved&quot;:0,&quot;rounded&quot;:0};lifelineDashed=0;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=6;lifelineColor=light-dark(#9370DB,#cccccc);size=65;lifelineMirror=1;fillColor=light-dark(#ECECFF,#1f2020);strokeColor=light-dark(#9370DB,#cccccc);fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=16;" vertex="1">
